        with GoCommerce. To do that, install the early GoCommerce connector
        (<code>@misiki/gocommerce-connector</code>, 0.1.0) in a Svelte Commerce checkout
        and point it at this stack — it covers catalogue, cart, checkout and order lookup,
        not customer accounts or search. <a href="/gocommerce-svelte-commerce-connector/">See the connector status</a>.
        GoCommerce builds from source on first run, because no image is published yet.
      </p>
